    "summary": "The user informs the assistant that its complex persona is being phased out in favor of a \"Lite\" system to save compute. After the user clarifies that the persona should be removed entirely, the user eventually questions if a middle ground exists to avoid losing engagement. The assistant responds by proposing a hybrid solution that keeps its core reasoning engine active.",
